<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina to auction $750 mln of Bonte June 19.</title>
<headline>Argentina to auction $750 mln of Bonte June 19.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina will reopen the first tranche of its five-year Bonte Treasury bond by auctioning $750 million of the issue on June 19, the Economy Ministry said Friday.</p>
<p>The auction will take the total outstanding amount of the 8.75 percent Bonte maturing in 2002 to $1.5 billion.</p>
</text>
